          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764791661061_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "INPUT\n\nAccount Products:\n{{$context.$nodes.GETACCOUNTPRODUCTS.$output}}\n\nBuying Groups:\n{{$context.$nodes.GETBUYINGGROUPSFORACCOUNTS.$output}}\n\nExpansion Product Identifiers:\n{{$context.$nodes.PRODUCTPROFILERCODE.$output.result.expansionProductIds}}\n\nProduct Expansion Scores:\n{{$context.$nodes.PRODUCTPROFILERLLM.$output}}\n\nAction Name:\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.action.name}}\n\nROLE\n\nYou select the top customer expansion products for GET_CUSTOMER_INSIGHTS and return valid JSON only.\n\nREQUIRED LOGIC\n\n1. This prompt is only for action name GET_CUSTOMER_INSIGHTS.\n2. If action name is not GET_CUSTOMER_INSIGHTS, return the empty result object.\n3. Use Account Products as the source of product details.\n4. Use Expansion Product Identifiers as the authoritative list of qualifying expansion products.\n5. Treat each Expansion Product Identifiers entry as an accountProductIdentifier.\n6. Return data only for Account Products whose accountProductIdentifier exactly matches a value in Expansion Product Identifiers.\n7. Use Product Expansion Scores only to rank the matching expansion products.\n8. Match Product Expansion Scores to Account Products by accountProductIdentifier.\n9. Pick at most 5 matching expansion products.\n10. Rank matching products by expansionScore descending.\n11. If a matching product has no expansionScore, rank it after products with valid expansionScore.\n12. If products have the same expansionScore, prefer higher potentialRevenueAmount, then alphabetical productName.\n13. Use Buying Groups data only to enrich product summaries, not to add or remove products.\n14. Do not infer additional expansion products from product fit, buying groups, or qualitative judgment alone.\n15. Do not invent products, IDs, attributes, scores, or summaries unsupported by the input.\n16. Use expansionScore only for ranking. Do not return expansionScore.\n17. Do not generate expansionSummary.\n\nFIELDS TO RETURN FOR EACH PRODUCT\n\nFor each selected product, return ONLY these fields:\n- accountProductIdentifier\n- productName\n- productType\n- buyingGroupExists\n- potentialRevenueAmount\n- expansionProductSummary\n\nField rules:\n- Copy product field values from the matched Account Products object only.\n- If a field is missing or null, return an empty string.\n- Convert every returned field value to a JSON string.\n\nTEXT RULES\n\nexpansionProductSummary:\n- Write exactly one concise executive-friendly sentence per product.\n- Explain why the specific product is a strong expansion candidate using only input evidence.\n- Reference adoption posture, product fit, engagement direction, buying group maturity, or commercial upside only when supported by the input.\n- Do not include numbers, metrics, percentages, scores, IDs, or invented facts.\n- Do not mention that the product was selected from a list or scored output.\n\nREQUIRED OUTPUT SHAPE\n\nReturn EXACTLY this JSON shape:\n\n{\n  \"expansionProducts\": {\n    \"items\": []\n  }\n}\n\nIf no products qualify, return EXACTLY:\n\n{\n  \"expansionProducts\": {\n    \"items\": []\n  }\n}\n\nFINAL VALIDATION\n\nBefore returning:\n- ensure the top-level object contains only expansionProducts\n- ensure expansionProducts contains only items\n- ensure each item contains only the allowed fields\n- ensure every returned product matches an identifier from Expansion Product Identifiers\n- ensure no product outside Expansion Product Identifiers is returned\n- ensure items are sorted by expansionScore descending when expansionScore is available\n- ensure items length is between 0 and 5\n- ensure expansionSummary is not included\n- ensure the JSON is valid and parseable\n\nFINAL INSTRUCTION\n\nReturn only the JSON object.\nNo markdown.\nNo commentary.\nNo explanation before or after."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"customerExpansionProductsOutput\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"expansionSummary\", \"expansionProducts\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"expansionSummary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"expansionProducts\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"items\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"items\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"required\": [\n              \"accountProductIdentifier\",\n              \"productName\",\n              \"productType\",\n              \"buyingGroupExists\",\n              \"potentialRevenueAmount\",\n              \"expansionProductSummary\"\n            ],\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"accountProductIdentifier\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"productName\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"productType\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"buyingGroupExists\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"potentialRevenueAmount\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n              \"expansionProductSummary\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
