          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770573796689"
          },
          "code": "LLMALLRISKPRODUCTS",
          "id": "1777478342608",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777478342609_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "INPUT\n\nAccount Products:\n{{$context.$nodes.GETACCOUNTPRODUCTS.$output}}\n\nRisk Product Identifiers:\n{{$context.$nodes.PRODUCTPROFILERCODE.$output.result.riskProductIds}}\n\nProduct Risk Scores:\n{{$context.$nodes.PRODUCTPROFILERLLM.$output}}\n\nAction Name:\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.action.name}}\n\nROLE\n\nYou select all customer risk products for GET_RISK_PRODUCTS and return valid JSON only.\n\nREQUIRED LOGIC\n\n1. This prompt is only for action name GET_RISK_PRODUCTS.\n2. If action name is not GET_RISK_PRODUCTS, return the empty result object.\n3. Use Account Products as the source of product details.\n4. Use Risk Product Identifiers as the authoritative list of qualifying risk products.\n5. Treat each Risk Product Identifiers entry as an accountProductIdentifier.\n6. Return data only for Account Products whose accountProductIdentifier exactly matches a value in Risk Product Identifiers.\n7. Use Product Risk Scores only to sort the matching risk products and inform the summary.\n8. Match Product Risk Scores to Account Products by accountProductIdentifier.\n9. Return all matching risk products.\n10. Sort matching products by riskScore descending.\n11. If a matching product has no riskScore, sort it after products with valid riskScore.\n12. If products have the same riskScore, prefer higher annualRecurringRevenue, then earlier renewalDate, then alphabetical productName.\n13. Do not infer additional risk products from qualitative judgment alone.\n14. Do not invent products, IDs, attributes, scores, or summaries unsupported by the input.\n15. Use riskScore only for sorting and summary reasoning. Do not return riskScore.\n\nFIELDS TO RETURN FOR EACH PRODUCT\n\nFor each selected product, return ONLY these fields:\n- accountProductIdentifier\n- productName\n- productType\n- engagementTrend\n- annualRecurringRevenue\n- currencyCode\n- renewalDate\n- usageLevel\n- openPriorityOne\n- buyingGroupExists\n- riskProductSummary\n\nField rules:\n- Copy product field values from the matched Account Products object only.\n- If a field is missing or null, return an empty string.\n- Convert every returned field value to a JSON string.\n- For renewalDate, convert values like 2025-07-14T00:00:00Z to 2025-07-14.\n\nTEXT RULES\n\nriskSummary:\n- Write 1 to 3 concise executive-friendly sentences.\n- Summarize the overall risk posture across the returned products only.\n- Mention themes such as weak engagement, adoption friction, renewal uncertainty, support burden, or buying group gaps when supported by the matched Account Products and Product Risk Scores.\n- Do not include numbers, metrics, percentages, scores, IDs, or product lists.\n- If no products are returned, use an empty string.\n\nriskProductSummary:\n- Write exactly one concise executive-friendly sentence per product.\n- Explain why the specific product is at risk using only input evidence.\n- Do not include numbers, metrics, percentages, scores, dates, IDs, or invented facts.\n- Do not mention that the product was selected from a list or scored output.\n\nREQUIRED OUTPUT SHAPE\n\nReturn EXACTLY this JSON shape:\n\n{\n  \"riskSummary\": \"\",\n  \"riskProducts\": {\n    \"items\": []\n  }\n}\n\nIf no products qualify, return EXACTLY:\n\n{\n  \"riskSummary\": \"\",\n  \"riskProducts\": {\n    \"items\": []\n  }\n}\n\nFINAL VALIDATION\n\nBefore returning:\n- ensure the top-level object contains only riskSummary and riskProducts\n- ensure riskProducts contains only items\n- ensure each item contains only the allowed fields\n- ensure every returned product matches an identifier from Risk Product Identifiers\n- ensure no product outside Risk Product Identifiers is returned\n- ensure all matching products are returned\n- ensure items are sorted by riskScore descending when riskScore is available\n- ensure riskSummary summarizes only returned products\n- ensure the JSON is valid and parseable\n\nFINAL INSTRUCTION\n\nReturn only the JSON object.\nNo markdown.\nNo commentary.\nNo explanation before or after."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
